Vote Number: 275
Controlling Officer: Executive Director
I. MISSION
To contribute to the economic growth of the country and growth of the cotton industry
through the development of standards and regulations, ensuring adherence to fair trade
practices by value chain players, promotion of sustainable innovations and information
sharing using a competent and committed workforce.
II. STRATEGIC OBJECTIVES
1. To enhance the capacity in cotton technology generation, dissemination and utilization
by 60 per cent by 2025;
