5. Conducted Eight (8) investigations and enforcement operations on illegal mining;
6. Conducted three (3) accident investigations involving legal and illegal mining
operations;
7. Finalized 18 regulations under the Mines and Minerals Act (2023) were finalized;
8. Developed eight (8) essential policies that govern various aspects of the Authority;
9. Four (4) vehicles were procured;
