To develop and grow MSMEs in Malawi through provision and facilitation of
demand-driven business development services and enterprise in formation for
sustainable socio-economic development
II. STRATEGIC OBJECTIVES
1. To enhance entrepreneurship and Enterprise development;
2. To enhance MSMEs infrastructure facilities;
3. To create a conducive policy implementation environment for MSMEs;
4. To enhance financial sustainability, governance and systems of the institution.
